{"complete":true,"city":"Antwerp","template_id":"global-zero-dollars","title":"Zero Dollars: 10 Things Locals Do for Free","description":"Ten Antwerp rituals with no ticket or purchase attached: sculpture walks, skyline views, river crossings, garden pauses, open-water laps and a few useful indoor escapes.","icon":"money_off","cards":[{"entity_name":"Middelheim Museum","title":"Browse sculpture beneath the trees","subtitle":"Middelheim Museum, Wilrijk","notes":"Admission to the museum park is free. Seasonal closing times apply, and last entry is 30 minutes before closing.","short_summary":"Follow the broad paths between modern and contemporary sculptures, then give whichever work catches you a second look.","source_url":"https://www.antwerpen.be/nl/info/53675047aba8a70d7f8b4573/middelheimmuseum","source_title":"Middelheimmuseum | Antwerpen","latitude":51.1814027,"longitude":4.4134096,"place_id":"ChIJcZFY_Sr3w0cRg4MYr6Y0ero","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJcZFY_Sr3w0cRg4MYr6Y0ero"},{"entity_name":"MAS Museum aan de Stroom","title":"Ride the escalators to the skyline","subtitle":"MAS Boulevard and rooftop panorama, Eilandje","notes":"The Boulevard and panorama are free without a ticket; museum galleries require admission. The rooftop’s final section is reached by stairs.","short_summary":"Spiral upward past changing displays, red sandstone and rippled glass until the city, Scheldt and docks spread out below.","source_url":"https://mas.be/en/node/6383","source_title":"Tickets & Rates | Museum MAS","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Sint-Anna ferry","title":"Cross the Scheldt by ferry","subtitle":"Steenplein to Linkeroever","notes":"The ferry carries pedestrians, cyclists and accompanied wheelchair users free of charge every day. Check the current timetable before leaving.","short_summary":"Use the river as the route: board beside Het Steen and step off at the Boeienweide with the city skyline behind you.","source_url":"https://www.slimnaarantwerpen.be/en/news/sint-anna-ferry-service-extended","source_title":"Sint-Anna ferry service extended | Smart Ways to Antwerp","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Cathedral of Our Lady","title":"Enter the cathedral with local ID","subtitle":"Onze-Lieve-Vrouwekathedraal, Handschoenmarkt","notes":"Admission is free for residents of Antwerp Province and visitors under 18. Other adults pay admission; bring proof of residency and check service-related closures.","short_summary":"Province residents can revisit the cathedral’s nave and art without turning the visit into a once-only occasion.","source_url":"https://www.dekathedraal.be/en/visit","source_title":"Plan your visit | Cathedral of Our Lady Antwerp","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Sportcentrum Het Rooi","title":"Run laps on the gravel track","subtitle":"Sportcentrum Het Rooi, Berchem","notes":"The city lists the illuminated 400-metre athletics track as freely accessible to individual joggers.","short_summary":"Trade traffic-light interruptions for measured laps on a proper outdoor track—no club session or day pass required.","source_url":"https://www.antwerpen.be/nl/overzicht/sporting-a/openluchtlocaties/sportcentrum-het-rooi-berchem","source_title":"Sportcentrum Het Rooi - Berchem | Antwerpen","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Park Spoor Noord skate and BMX park","title":"Practise a line in the skate bowl","subtitle":"Park Spoor Noord, Antwerpen-Noord","notes":"The city’s Park Spoor Noord information states that the skate and BMX park is open daily and freely accessible.","short_summary":"Bring a board, skates or BMX and repeat the same line until the concrete starts to feel familiar.","source_url":"https://stadsvernieuwing.antwerpen.be/docs/stad/stadsvernieuwing/spoor%20noord/faq%20aangepast.pdf","source_title":"Veel gestelde vragen over Park Spoor Noord | Stad Antwerpen","latitude":51.2305004,"longitude":4.4213661,"place_id":"ChIJrSDqeq73w0cRRCuG0fY3ZPs","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJrSDqeq73w0cRRCuG0fY3ZPs"},{"entity_name":"'t ZwemDok","title":"Swim a free half-hour in the dock","subtitle":"Bonapartedok, beside the MAS","notes":"Seasonal weekend entry is free, but advance reservation is compulsory. Swimmers must be at least 12 and able to swim; weather or water quality can close the site.","short_summary":"Choose a 50-metre lane or the recreational zone for an open-water interval framed by quay walls and the MAS.","source_url":"https://www.antwerpen.be/nl/overzicht/sporting-a/zwembaden/t-zwemdok-zwemmen-in-het-bonapartedok","source_title":"'t ZwemDok - zwemmen in het Bonapartedok | Antwerpen","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Antwerp public libraries","title":"Read or work without buying a seat","subtitle":"Sixteen neighborhood libraries across Antwerp","notes":"City library guidance says the libraries are freely accessible for working or relaxing. Borrowing materials requires a library subscription.","short_summary":"Settle in with your own notes or browse on site when home feels cramped and a café purchase feels unnecessary.","source_url":"https://antwerpen.bibliotheek.be/sites/default/files/uploads/2021-11/18089878_Bib_brochure%20Digitaal_WEBVERSIE.pdf","source_title":"De bib vernieuwt | Bibliotheek Antwerpen","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Den Botaniek","title":"Pause among medicinal plants","subtitle":"Botanical Garden, Leopoldstraat","notes":"The city explicitly lists admission as free. The greenhouse is temporarily closed, but the garden remains the central free visit.","short_summary":"Take a quiet circuit through the compact botanical collection, where labels turn a short bench break into plant reconnaissance.","source_url":"https://www.antwerpen.be/info/52d5052239d8a6ec798b4943/den-botaniek","source_title":"Den Botaniek | Antwerpen","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Provinciaal Groendomein Rivierenhof","title":"Visit the farm, maze and playgrounds","subtitle":"Rivierenhof, Deurne","notes":"The Province’s Antwerp guide identifies the children’s farm, playgrounds, maze and sandpit as free offerings. Individual attractions keep their own access hours.","short_summary":"Build an afternoon around the domain’s no-ticket circuit: animals, a maze, sand and room to walk between stops.","source_url":"https://www.provincieantwerpen.be/content/dam/provant/dvt/TPA/newsfeed/Budgetvriendelijk%20op%20stap%20-%20Stad%20Antwerpen.pdf","source_title":"Budgetvriendelijk op stap – Stad Antwerpen | Provincie Antwerpen","latitude":51.2149878,"longitude":4.4705487,"place_id":"ChIJDWw3Dn73w0cRaoueQJNFZEs","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJDWw3Dn73w0cRaoueQJNFZEs"}],"warnings":[]}
