n.be/info/52d5052239d8a6ec798b4943/den-botaniek","source_title":"Den Botaniek | Antwerpen","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Provinciaal Groendomein Rivierenhof","title":"Visit the farm, maze and playgrounds","subtitle":"Rivierenhof, Deurne","notes":"The Province’s Antwerp guide identifies the children’s farm, playgrounds, maze and sandpit as free offerings. Individual attractions keep their own access hours.","short_summary":"Build an afternoon around the domain’s no-ticket circuit: animals, a maze, sand and room to walk between stops.","source_url":"https://www.provincieantwerpen.be/content/dam/provant/dvt/TPA/newsfeed/Budgetvriendelijk%20op%20stap%20-%20Stad%20Antwerpen.pdf","source_title":"Budgetvriendelijk op stap – Stad Antwerpen | Provincie Antwerpen","latitude":51.2149878,"longitude":4.4705487,"place_id":"ChIJDWw3Dn73w0cRaoueQJNFZEs","maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/place/?q=place_id:ChIJDWw3Dn73w0cRaoueQJNFZEs"}],"warnings":[]}
